what is the hands-on-ai python package and what can it do

AI:
hands-on-ai is a Python teaching package that wraps LLM API calls into simple functions designed for students learning AI-powered programming. It provides three main capabilities for your project. The chat module gives you get_response() which sends a message to the language model and returns the reply. The RAG module gives you get_answer() which retrieves an answer from a document you provide. The agent module lets you register Python functions as tools the LLM can call. All three connect to the Ollama server at ollama.serveur.au using your API key, so you do not need to manage API connections yourself.

